          "config": {
            "alias": "Lawn watering: start cycle",
            "description": "Waters the front lawn at 05:00 for the Smart Irrigation computed duration, then turns off and calls smart_irrigation.reset_bucket so the deficit resets. SI calculates at 04:00; this runs the valve at 05:00 when there is a positive duration AND the last watering was >=2 days ago (deep-and-infrequent watering, user 2026-07-13 \u2014 deficit accumulates across skipped days). Calibrated 2026-07-13: zone throughput 13.4 L/min (METER-MEASURED: 67 L in 5 min; was 25) and zone maximum_duration raised to 5400 s, so expect ~40-80 min runs every other day (~25 mm/week incl. rain credit). run_seconds capped at 5400 s; the valve_2 Max Runtime Failsafe (100 min) is the independent hard backstop. 2026-07-14 (FINAL): valve runs on TUYA CLOUD. switch.dual_outlet_irrigation_timer_switch_2 (outlet 1 unused, user-confirmed). WHY NOT ZHA: the valve is a sleepy battery end device (receiver off when idle) and the ZHA network has ZERO routers \u2014 just the coordinator and this valve. Downlink to a sleepy device needs a parent to buffer until it polls; the bare CC2652 ages the entry out in ~15-35 min, after which every command dies with NWK_NO_ROUTE. Re-pairing fixes it for about half an hour, then it silently rots. This caused a 2-day dry lawn that LOOKED healthy in every log, because the ZHA switch entity is written from a LocalDataCluster BEFORE the radio send: it reads \"on\" even when delivery fails outright. LQI/last_seen looked perfect throughout \u2014 they only measure UPLINK. DO NOT move back to ZHA without first adding a mains-powered Zigbee router near the tap. WHY THE SWITCH STATE IS TRUSTED HERE: unlike ZHA, the Tuya switch state is a real round trip (HA -> cloud -> gateway -> device -> back). Measured 2026-07-14: 25 s to confirm ON, 10 s to confirm OFF, with live water verified at the sprinkler. An optimistic cache flips instantly; a multi-second confirm is a genuine device report. Hence the 90 s wait timeouts below (45 s was sized for local ZHA and is too tight). TRADE-OFF: this path needs the internet. No internet => no watering AND no failure push (notify goes out via FCM). It fails closed and silent \u2014 check the lawn if the connection has been down. NOTE: Tuya exposes only switch_1/switch_2/battery \u2014 there is no status or countdown sensor on this path, so the switch state is the only run signal available. STILL UNEXPLAINED: on 2026-07-13 05:00 (before the route broke) a delivered command made the device report a real 1070 s run and NO water reached the lawn (camera). No theory fits. If a confirmed run ever produces no water again, start there.\n",
            "id": "lawn_watering_start",
            "mode": "single",
            "triggers": [
              {
                "trigger": "time",
                "at": "05:00:00"
              }
            ],
            "conditions": [
              {
                "condition": "numeric_state",
                "entity_id": "sensor.smart_irrigation_front_lawn_valve_2",
                "above": 0
              },
              {
                "condition": "state",
                "entity_id": "input_boolean.lawn_watering_master_enable",
                "state": "on"
              },
              {
                "condition": "template",
                "value_template": "{{ state_attr('input_datetime.lawn_last_watered', 'timestamp') is none\n   or (now().timestamp() - state_attr('input_datetime.lawn_last_watered', 'timestamp')) >= 169200 }}"
              }
            ],
            "actions": [
              {
                "variables": {
                  "run_seconds": "{{ [ states('sensor.smart_irrigation_front_lawn_valve_2') | float(0) | round(0) | int, 5400 ] | min }}"
                }
              },
              {
                "repeat": {
                  "sequence": [
                    {
                      "action": "switch.turn_on",
                      "target": {
                        "entity_id": "switch.dual_outlet_irrigation_timer_switch_2"
                      },
                      "continue_on_error": true
                    },
                    {
                      "delay": "00:00:15"
                    },
                    {
                      "action": "homeassistant.update_entity",
                      "target": {
                        "entity_id": "switch.dual_outlet_irrigation_timer_switch_2"
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "wait_template": "{{ is_state('switch.dual_outlet_irrigation_timer_switch_2', 'on') }}",
                      "timeout": "00:01:30",
                      "continue_on_timeout": true
                    }
                  ],
                  "until": "{{ is_state('switch.dual_outlet_irrigation_timer_switch_2', 'on') or repeat.index >= 3 }}"
                }
              },
              {
                "if": [
                  {
                    "condition": "template",
                    "value_template": "{{ not is_state('switch.dual_outlet_irrigation_timer_switch_2', 'on') }}"
                  }
                ],
                "then": [
                  {
                    "action": "notify.mobile_app_cph2655",
                    "data": {
                      "title": "\ud83d\udea8 Lawn watering FAILED to start",
                      "message": "Front lawn valve never confirmed ON after 3 attempts (it reports '{{ states('switch.dual_outlet_irrigation_timer_switch_2') }}'). The command did not reach the valve. Check, in order: (1) is the internet up \u2014 this path is Tuya CLOUD; (2) does the valve respond in the Tuya app \u2014 if not, remove + re-add it there; (3) battery is {{ states('sensor.dual_outlet_irrigation_timer_battery') }}%. Bucket NOT reset \u2014 the {{ (run_seconds / 60) | round(1) }} min deficit carries to the next run. Lawn was NOT watered."
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "stop": "valve never confirmed on - deficit preserved for next run"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "delay": {
                  "seconds": "{{ run_seconds }}"
                }
              },
              {
                "repeat": {
                  "sequence": [
                    {
                      "action": "switch.turn_off",
                      "target": {
                        "entity_id": "switch.dual_outlet_irrigation_timer_switch_2"
                      },
                      "continue_on_error": true
                    },
                    {
                      "wait_template": "{{ is_state('switch.dual_outlet_irrigation_timer_switch_2', 'off') }}",
                      "timeout": "00:01:30",
                      "continue_on_timeout": true
                    }
                  ],
                  "until": "{{ is_state('switch.dual_outlet_irrigation_timer_switch_2', 'off') or repeat.index >= 4 }}"
                }
              },
              {
                "if": [
                  {
                    "condition": "template",
                    "value_template": "{{ not is_state('switch.dual_outlet_irrigation_timer_switch_2', 'off') }}"
                  }
                ],
                "then": [
                  {
                    "action": "notify.mobile_app_cph2655",
                    "data": {
                      "title": "\ud83d\udea8 Lawn valve did NOT close",
                      "message": "valve_2 has not reported 'Idle' after 4 close attempts (device reports '{{ states('switch.dual_outlet_irrigation_timer_switch_2') }}'). The valve may still be running. The 100-min failsafe is the backstop \u2014 go check the tap."
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "action": "smart_irrigation.reset_bucket",
                "target": {
                  "entity_id": "sensor.smart_irrigation_front_lawn_valve_2"
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "input_datetime.set_datetime",
                "target": {
                  "entity_id": "input_datetime.lawn_last_watered"
                },
                "data": {
                  "datetime": "{{ now().strftime('%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S') }}"
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "notify.mobile_app_cph2655",
                "data": {
                  "title": "\u2705 Front lawn watered",
                  "message": "Ran {{ run_seconds }} s ({{ (run_seconds / 60) | round(1) }} min), Smart Irrigation calc. Bucket reset."
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          "blueprint_inputs": null,
          "context": {
            "id": "01KYETE4V6E2KQBB6HPGPPYEV3",
            "parent_id": null,
            "user_id": null
          }
        },
        "short_dict": {
          "last_step": "condition/2",
          "run_id": "952c8de2be93ce61b3f22792d1bc5157",
          "state": "stopped",
          "script_execution": "failed_conditions",
          "timestamp": {
            "start": "2026-07-26T09:00:00.230155+00:00",
            "finish": "2026-07-26T09:00:00.230627+00:00"
          },
          "domain": "automation",
          "item_id": "lawn_watering_start",
          "trigger": "time"
        }
      }
    ],
